{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_11212520","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11212520","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1121252001:0":{"text":"Aves 11, you're looking much better. How are you feeling?","source_cn":"阿尔法十一，我看你的脸色好了不少。你自己感觉还行吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7A6F5F1B6E69FDA6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1121252002:0":{"text":"After drinking your candy, my body doesn't hurt anymore. I never knew that candy could be like water.","source_cn":"喝了你们的糖果后，身体已经不痛了。我第一次知道，还有水...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x720246C59E0F9569","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1121252003:0":{"text":"That was a herbal soup, not candy. When you're all better, I'll show you what real candy tastes like.","source_cn":"那叫药汤，不是糖果。\\n等你病好以后，再去尝尝真正的糖...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x52E00FFF0F609B78","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1121252004:0":{"text":"Now, you must remember this for me. Take these pills three times a day before meals. And you mustn't skip any meals!","source_cn":"现在你可给我记住了，这些药，一天三次，饭前服用，一顿都...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x453412F986C9F412","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1121252005:0":{"text":"Okay, I'll remember.","source_cn":"哦……我记住了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x311A6DBB2A25E9ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1121252006:0":{"text":"What's this, now? Times like this, it's proper to say thank you.","source_cn":"哦什么哦？这种时候要说谢谢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5E85007E89769358","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1121252007:0":{"text":"Thank you.","source_cn":"谢谢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF1466BFD05AD334A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1121252008:0":{"text":"Not to me, but to Lenya and the others. If they hadn't brought you back in time, you might not be with us any more.","source_cn":"不是对我说，而是对蕾米雅他们。要不是他们及时带你回来，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC71D8ED29A31BC3B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1121252009:0":{"text":"Thank you, Lenya and Lyca.","source_cn":"谢谢你们……蕾米雅，莱卡。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A09A5859774B68D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1121252010:0":{"text":"And you as well, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>.","source_cn